Package: ucdpR
Title: Access and Work with Uppsala Conflict Data Program Data
Version: 0.7.2
Authors@R: person(
    "Christian", "Oswald",
    email = "christian.oswald@unibw.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8291-9544")
  )
Description: Provides tools for reproducible research with datasets published
    by the Uppsala Conflict Data Program ('UCDP') <https://ucdp.uu.se/>. It
    discovers the official download catalog at run time, downloads and imports
    current or historical releases, retrieves official codebooks, records and
    summarizes source metadata, validates common data structures and ranges,
    supports spatial and precision-aware workflows, aggregates events and
    fatality estimates, constructs explicitly labelled analytical panels,
    harmonizes country codes and prepares data for 'priogrid' and
    'peacesciencer' workflows, exposes official replication materials and
    version histories, and helps
    examine changes between dataset versions. UCDP data are not bundled or
    modified.
